# A reboot at 3 am with no internet (2026-10-28, an audit: without a clock the night rules ended after two minutes).
# The clock never syncs; the room is dark, the owner asleep next to the robot, a few sounds in the night. Night rules
# must hold: no call, no gesture.
duration 8:00
clock 03:00
seed 5
room_light off
owner home
at 0:00 fault ntp on
at 3:00 clap 20 0.6
at 5:00 talk 0 1.5 0.5
